37,2,1,talk,May,,"@Ryuji, that imbalance is exactly what I suspected. We paid sixty-eight thousand yen for a room that seats four, while we waste twenty-five minutes daily walking for lunch.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
