39,2,1,talk,Servas,,"@Shunichi, the crumbs are daily, but the silence after that awkward talk lasted two weeks. We need a space that allows for both mess and meaningful connection.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Shunichi, neither fit-out addresses the core failure: undefined responsibility. The tally proves the burden is uneven. We need a system that assigns duties, not just hardware.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Shunichi, hardware won’t fix the distance. The wall is thin, yet we still hide. We need a space that invites the difficult conversations we’ve been avoiding.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
